		<language name="English">Can I get an amen?\nHoly fire from the\nheavens. Often burns\nthe foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00222" index="222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant bass flops all\nover the block. Random\nstrength. Hits\neverybody.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00223" index="223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lights an M-80 by the\nfoe. Confuses them if\nit lands.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00224" index="224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rams the foe with a\npolice bullhorn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00225" index="225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eats a raw onion and\nbreathes on the foe.\nMay paralyze.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00226" index="226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Passes it off to a\nteammate, stat changes\nand all.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00227" index="227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Run it back. The foe\nrepeats its last move\na few turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00228" index="228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chases down a foe\ntrying to switch out.\nDouble damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00229" index="229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Laps round the foe on\na BMX. Clears traps\nlike thumbtacks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00230" index="230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Way too much cologne.\nLowers evasion. Draws\nwild homies outside.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00231" index="231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wrecking ball. May\nlower the foe’s\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00232" index="232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brass knucks. May\nraise the user’s\nAttack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00233" index="233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not on the list.\nBounced out the club.\nGoes last but never\nmisses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00234" index="234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Snooze, snooze, then\nrise and grind.\nRestores HP depending\non the weather.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00235" index="235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ring light, flashes,\nglow up. Restores HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00236" index="236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lays out under the\nmoon with a tanning\nreflector. Restores\nHP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00237" index="237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pulls the hidden\nstrap. Its type\ndepends on the user.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00238" index="238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Strings a clothesline\nand the foe runs into\nit. Lands critical\nhits easy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00239" index="239">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A tornado. May make\nthe foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00240" index="240">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Makes it rain for 5\nturns. Water moves get\nstronger.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00241" index="241">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Beach chair,\nreflector, sun cranked\nup for 5 turns. Fire\nmoves get stronger.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00242" index="242">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A hollow point round.\nMay lower the foe’s\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00243" index="243">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mirror tint on the\nwindows. Special\nattacks bounce back\ndouble.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00244" index="244">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The hype man gets them\ngoing, copying the\nfoe’s stat changes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00245" index="245">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The getaway, on a\nrental scooter. Goes\nfirst with a hard hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00246" index="246">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OG power. May raise\nall of the user’s\nstats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00247" index="247">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rolls a Magic 8-Ball\nat the foe. Outlook\nnot good. May lower\nSp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00248" index="248">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Has a premonition. The\nhit lands two turns\nlater.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00249" index="249">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Smash and grab. May\nlower the foe’s\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00250" index="250">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flushes the foe down a\nswirl for two to five\nturns. Clears\nwhirlpools outside.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00251" index="251">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The whole crew pulls\nup, one at a time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00252" index="252">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Crossover, crossover.\nBreaks the foe’s\nankles. First turn\nonly. Flinches.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00253" index="253">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Turns up for three\nturns. Nobody sleeps.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00254" index="254">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stacks pancakes. Up to\nthree. Raises Defense\nand Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00255" index="255">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spits the bars stored\nup. More Stockpile,\nmore damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00256" index="256">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Takes the L. Swallows\nit whole and heals off\nwhat it stockpiled.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00257" index="257">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cranks the thermostat\nto 99. May burn the\nfoe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00258" index="258">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A bag of ice bursts in\nthe sky. Hails on\neverybody for five\nturns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00259" index="259">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clowns on the foe so\nbad they can’t use the\nsame move twice in a\nrow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00260" index="260">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gasses the foe up till\nthey’re confused.\nRaises their Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00261" index="261">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flicks a Bic at the\nfoe. Burns them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00262" index="262">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Faints, but the RIP\ntee hits so hard the\nfoe’s Attack and Sp.\nAtk drop way down.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00263" index="263">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stunts in a rental.\nHits harder when\nburned, poisoned or\nparalyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00264" index="264">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Squares up for a fair\none. Fails if the user\ngets hit first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00265" index="265">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A gym sock under the\nnose. Double damage if\nthey’re paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00266" index="266">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“LOOK AT ME.” Every\nfoe has to target the\nuser.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00267" index="267">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The bodega cat handles\nit. Changes with the\nspot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00268" index="268">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plugs in the amp. Next\nElectric move hits\ntwice as hard.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00269" index="269">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Drops a diss track.\nThe foe can only\nattack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00270" index="270">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The secret handshake.\nPowers up an ally’s\nmove.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00271" index="271">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shell game. The foe\nalways picks wrong.\nSwaps held items.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00272" index="272">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cheap costume of the\nfoe. Copies its\nAbility.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00273" index="273">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blows out the birthday\ncandles. Heals next\nturn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00274" index="274">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tags in a random\nteammate’s move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00275" index="275">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Posts up in a lawn\nchair. Heals every\nturn but can’t leave.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00276" index="276">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Maxes out on\neverything, even the\nvending machine.\nLowers Attack and\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00277" index="277">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hops in a bouncy\ncastle. Status moves\nbounce right back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00278" index="278">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Digs through the\nrecycling. Gets back a\nused item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00279" index="279">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Their name’s on the\nlist. Double damage if\nthe user got hit this\nturn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00280" index="280">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Karate chops through\nbricks. Breaks the\nfoe’s Reflect and\nLight Screen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00281" index="281">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Reads them the terms\nand conditions. They\nfall asleep next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00282" index="282">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sells the foe a\nbootleg. It falls\napart in their hands.\nKnocks off their item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00283" index="283">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rise and grind. Cuts\nthe foe’s HP down to\nmatch the user’s.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00284" index="284">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Its phone blows up.\nStronger the more HP\nthe user has.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00285" index="285">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Trades cards with the\nfoe. Then trades\nspots. Swaps\nAbilities.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00286" index="286">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Locks up every move\nthe foe shares with\nthe user.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00287" index="287">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scrubs the kicks\nclean. Heals burn,\npoison and paralysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00288" index="288">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pins the foe’s photo\nto the dartboard. If\nthe user goes down, so\ndoes that move’s PP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00289" index="289">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scam calls the foe.\nSteals their healing\nor stat move and uses\nit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00290" index="290">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An inside job. Its\nside effect depends on\nthe spot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00291" index="291">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cannonballs into the\nkiddie pool, then\nsplashes up under the\nfoe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00292" index="292">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shoves the foe off\nwith a push broom, 2-5\ntimes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00293" index="293">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi-vis vest and a\nclipboard. Blends in\nanywhere. Changes\ntype.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00294" index="294">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bonnet off, edges\nlaid. A whole glow up.\nDrastically raises Sp.\nAtk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00295" index="295">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flicks the brights on\nthe foe. Blink, blink,\nFULL BEAMS. May lower\nSp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00296" index="296">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The club fog machine,\ncranked all the way.\nMay lower Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00297" index="297">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pillow fight till\nthe pillow bursts.\nSharply lowers the\nfoe’s Attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00298" index="298">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Does the Wobble.\nEverybody on the floor\ngets confused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00299" index="299">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tiptoes over hot\nasphalt, then a\nflaming kick. High\ncrit ratio. May burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00300" index="300">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spa day in a mud bath.\nWeakens Electric\nmoves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00301" index="301">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Packs and throws\nsnowballs for five\nturns, harder each\nhit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00302" index="302">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Swab, needle, jab. May\nmake the foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00303" index="303">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kicks back in the\nrecliner. Restores\nhalf its max HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00304" index="304">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hypes so loud it\nhurts. Yeah! What!\nOkay!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00305" index="305">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Feeds the foe gas\nstation sushi. May\nbadly poison.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00306" index="306">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grabbed by the claw\nmachine. May lower\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00307" index="307">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lighter fluid on the\ngrill. Too much. The\nuser rests next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00308" index="308">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cracks the fire\nhydrant wide open. The\nuser rests next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00309" index="309">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A slam dunk from\norbit. May raise the\nuser’s Attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00310" index="310">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You’ve been served.\nMay make the foe\nflinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00311" index="311">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shakes a snow globe of\nthe block till the\nweather inside goes\nwild, then throws it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00312" index="312">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hangs up air freshener\ntrees. Heals the\nteam’s status.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00313" index="313">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Crocodile tears.\nSharply lowers the\nfoe’s Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00314" index="314">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A ceiling fan on HIGH\nflings its blades.\nHigh critical-hit\nratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00315" index="315">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Burns the toast. Smoke\nalarm going off.\nSharply lowers the\nuser’s Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00316" index="316">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Calls the K9 unit.\nGhosts get hit and\nevasion gets ignored.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00317" index="317">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dump truck buries\nthe foe in gravel.\nLowers Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00318" index="318">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A glitter bomb. It’s\nnever coming out. May\nraise all stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00319" index="319">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fork on a\nchalkboard. Sharply\nlowers the foe’s Sp.\nDef.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00320" index="320">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Candles, roses, a slow\njam. The foe falls\nasleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00321" index="321">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A feather duster. The\nfoe can’t stop\nlaughing. Lowers\nAttack and Defense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00322" index="322">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The galaxy durag goes\non. Raises Defense and\nSp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00323" index="323">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pumps a giant water\ngun. Stronger the more\nHP the user has.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00324" index="324">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Finds full bars and\nblasts the foe with\nwifi. May confuse.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00325" index="325">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sneaks up in a\ncardboard box. Never\nmisses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00326" index="326">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant eye opens in\nthe sky and reads\ntheir future. May make\nthe foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00327" index="327">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An uppercut that sends\nthe foe to the moon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00328" index="328">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stacks sandbags around\nthe foe for two to\nfive turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00329" index="329">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Puts the foe on ice.\nIf it hits, they’re a\ncold case.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00330" index="330">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A car through the\npuddle at the bus\nstop. May lower\naccuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00331" index="331">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spits sunflower seeds\nlike a machine gun,\ntwo to five times.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00332" index="332">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An ace shot that never\nmisses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00333" index="333">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chips off ice with an\nice pick, 2-5 times.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00334" index="334">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pot on the head,\nbaking sheet up.\nSharply raises\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00335" index="335">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blocked. The foe can’t\nleave.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00336" index="336">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AWOOO - the whole\ncrowd howls back.\nRaises Attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00337" index="337">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant lobster claw.\nClamps on. Old Bay\neverywhere.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00338" index="338">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plants bullets. Grows\na garden of guns. The\nuser rests next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00339" index="339">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits the gym. Raises\nAttack and Defense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00340" index="340">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pogos off the top of\nthe screen, lands on\nthe foe’s head next\nturn. May paralyze.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00341" index="341">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mud pie to the face.\nLowers the foe’s\nSpeed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00342" index="342">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A subway rat whips the\nfoe with its tail. May\npoison.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00343" index="343">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Lemme see that real\nquick.” Walks off with\nthe foe’s item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00344" index="344">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grabs a downed power\nline and charges. Big\nrecoil. May paralyze.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00345" index="345">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bills fly out the\nfanny pack. Never\nmisses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00346" index="346">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Super Soaker and the\nsprinkler dance.\nWeakens Fire moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00347" index="347">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cucumbers on the eyes.\nRaises Sp. Atk and Sp.\nDef.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00348" index="348">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Edges the foe with a\nweed whacker. Lands\ncritical hits easy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00349" index="349">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Does the shmoney\ndance. Raises Attack\nand Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00350" index="350">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pebbles at their\nwindow, two to five\ntimes. You up?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00351" index="351">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rubs a balloon on its\nhead. The static never\nmisses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00352" index="352">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A water balloon to the\ndome. May leave the\nfoe dazed and\nconfused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00353" index="353">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Black cat, broken\nmirror, then the sky\nfalls two turns later.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00354" index="354">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mind blown. Sharply\nlowers the user’s Sp.\nAtk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00355" index="355">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Crashes on an air\nmattress. Heals half\nits HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00356" index="356">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everybody’s pants sag\nfor five turns.\nNobody’s flying\nanywhere.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00357" index="357">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Night vision goggles.\nGhosts can’t hide.\nEvasion ignored.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00358" index="358">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The alarm, then the\nchancla. Double damage\non a sleeping foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00359" index="359">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whack-a-mole, but the\nfoe’s the mole. Lowers\nthe user’s Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00360" index="360">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flings a gold fidget\nspinner. Stronger the\nslower the user is.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00361" index="361">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Makes a wish on a\nshooting star and is\ngone. The next one in\ngets fully healed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00362" index="362">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Salt in the wound.\nDouble damage if the\nfoe is under half HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00363" index="363">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Throws whatever fruit\nit’s holding.\nPineapple, watermelon.\nType depends on the\nfruit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00364" index="364">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Breaks the foe’s\nankles. Hits even\nthrough Protect or\nDetect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00365" index="365">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grabs the foe’s berry\nwith a reacher. Eats\nit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00366" index="366">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tailgate party.\nDoubles the team’s\nSpeed for a few turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00367" index="367">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A coin in the mall\nmassage chair. Sharply\nraises a random stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00368" index="368">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Takes the hit, then\npays it back with\ninterest.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00369" index="369">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits on an e-scooter,\nthen pulls a U-turn\nand swaps out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00370" index="370">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A throwdown. Lowers\nthe user’s Defense and\nSp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00371" index="371">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gets back at the foe:\ntheir stuff out on the\nlawn. Twice as hard if\nit moved first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00372" index="372">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
