	<row id="msg_0749_00373" index="373">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Caution tape and an\nevidence bag. The foe\ncan’t use items.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00374" index="374">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tosses the held item\nat the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00375" index="375">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hot potato. Passes its\nstatus problem to the\nfoe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00376" index="376">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plays the reverse\ncard. Stronger the\nless PP it has left.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00377" index="377">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“You’re cut off.” The\nfoe can’t heal for\nfive turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00378" index="378">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shakes the foe down.\nStronger the more HP\nthey got.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00379" index="379">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flips the script:\nswaps Attack and\nDefense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00380" index="380">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A gas station hot dog.\nThe foe’s Ability is\nout of commission.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00381" index="381">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rubs the rabbit foot.\nThe team can’t take\ncrits for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00382" index="382">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
