	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00388" index="388">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">3 a.m. thoughts. The\nfoe can’t sleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00389" index="389">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cheap shot before\nthe foe attacks. Goes\nfirst.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00390" index="390">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
