	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00392" index="392">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kicks back on a pool\nfloat. Restores a\nlittle HP every turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00393" index="393">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hops on a hoverboard\nand somehow it floats.\nImmune to Ground moves\nfor five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00394" index="394">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rides a flaming\nshopping cart into the\nfoe. Big recoil. May\nburn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00395" index="395">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A stiff arm to the\nface. May paralyze.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00396" index="396">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Farms aura pose by\npose, then throws all\nof it. Never misses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00397" index="397">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
