	<row id="msg_0749_00398" index="398">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dirty shiv. May\npoison the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00399" index="399">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pure dark vibes off a\nblack candle. May make\nthe foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00400" index="400">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lights out, then slash\nmarks. High critical-\nhit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00401" index="401">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Snaps the foe with a\nwet durag.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00402" index="402">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ch-ch-ch-chia. Grows a\nwhole chia afro on the\nfoe till it bursts.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00403" index="403">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flurry of past due\nbills. May make the\nfoe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00404" index="404">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
