	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00405" index="405">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One mosquito. The foe\nslaps themself. May\nlower Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00406" index="406">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The parade dragon\ndances in.\nFirecrackers\neverywhere.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00407" index="407">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rush hour stampede off\nthe subway. May make\nthe foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00408" index="408">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fires a beam off the\nuser’s chain.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00409" index="409">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Taxes the foe with a\npunch. Heals half the\ndamage dealt.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00410" index="410">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">High noon. Draws\nfirst. Always goes\nfirst.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00411" index="411">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A firework mortar. Big\nblast, bad aim. May\nlower Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00412" index="412">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shotguns an energy\ndrink, fires the\ncaffeine. May lower\nSp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00413" index="413">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cape on, goggles down,\noff the roof of the\nprojects. Full send.\nBig recoil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00414" index="414">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The manhole blows and\nlaunches the foe. May\nlower Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00415" index="415">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shell game with two\nbags. Swaps held items\nwith the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00416" index="416">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plows into the foe in\nan 18-wheeler. The\nuser has to recover\nnext turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00417" index="417">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pulls out the\nconspiracy board. It’s\nall connected. Sharply\nraises Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00418" index="418">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Works the speed bag,\nthen the foe. Always\ngoes first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00419" index="419">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A snow plow dumps a\nwall of snow. Twice as\nhard if hit first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00420" index="420">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flicks ice cubes from\nthe cup. Always goes\nfirst.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00421" index="421">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Claws rip up out of\nthe foe’s shadow. High\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00422" index="422">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jumper cables to the\nfoe. May paralyze or\nflinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00423" index="423">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chugs a slushie, brain\nfreeze, icy chomp. May\nfreeze or flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00424" index="424">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A hot grill bite. May\nburn or flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00425" index="425">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Footsteps behind the\nfoe. Always goes\nfirst.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00426" index="426">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pigeon drops one\nright on the foe’s\nhead. May lower\naccuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00427" index="427">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Throws shade.\nLiterally: a\nlampshade, spinning.\nHigh crit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00428" index="428">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rings the singing\nbowl, then a full-\nspeed headbutt. May\nmake the foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00429" index="429">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spinner rims catch the\nsun right in the foe’s\neyes. May lower\naccuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00430" index="430">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A disposable camera\nflash. Seeing spots.\nMay lower Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00431" index="431">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Parkours off\neverything and lands\non the foe. May\nconfuse them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00432" index="432">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Opens a window and\nfans out the fog with\na pizza box. Lowers\nthe foe’s evasion.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00433" index="433">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits SLOW on the\nremote. The slow move\nfirst for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00434" index="434">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Meteors. Then a bigger\none. Sharply lowers\nthe user’s Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00435" index="435">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Six cords, one outlet.\nShocks everybody. May\nparalyze.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00436" index="436">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The lava lamp erupts\non everybody. May\nburn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00437" index="437">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A storm of zaza. Hits\nhard but sharply\nlowers the user’s Sp.\nAtk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00438" index="438">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Goes and gets the\nextension cord.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00439" index="439">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wrecking ball. Third\nswing hits. The user\nrests next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00440" index="440">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tags the foe with a\ndirty spray-paint X.\nHigh crit ratio. May\npoison.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00441" index="441">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The garbage truck\nunloads on the foe.\nMay poison.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00442" index="442">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A steel core round.\nMay make the foe\nflinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00443" index="443">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant magnet drags\nthe foe in and the\nhubcaps pile on. Never\nmisses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00444" index="444">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shades on, rocks up.\nHigh critical-hit\nratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00445" index="445">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A smooth pickup line.\nSharply lowers Sp. Atk\nof the other gender.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00446" index="446">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lays a spike strip on\nthe foe’s side. Hurts\nanybody who swaps in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00447" index="447">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gets the foe laced.\nThe heavier they are,\nthe harder they fall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00448" index="448">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yaps nonstop till the\nfoe’s head spins. May\nconfuse.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00449" index="449">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Court’s in session.\nThe gavel comes down.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00450" index="450">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bed bugs. If the foe’s\nholding a Berry, the\nuser eats it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00451" index="451">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charges the phone to\n100% and fires. May\nraise Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00452" index="452">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Measures twice, then\njust swings the two-\nby-four. Big recoil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00453" index="453">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jet ski to the face.\nAlways goes first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00454" index="454">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Order placed. Every\ndelivery driver in the\ncity pulls up. High\ncrit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00455" index="455">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mall cops on segways\nsurround the user.\nRaises Defense and Sp.\nDef.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00456" index="456">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Honey in the tea.\nHeals half its max HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00457" index="457">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Headbangs straight\ninto the foe. Huge\nrecoil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00458" index="458">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ding ding. Two quick\njabs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00459" index="459">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clocks out so hard\ntime stops. The user\nrests next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00460" index="460">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Unzips space itself.\nLands critical hits\neasy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00461" index="461">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Moonwalks off for\ngood. The one who\ncomes in next gets\nfully healed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00462" index="462">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Into the trash\ncompactor. Stronger\nthe more HP the foe\nhas.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00463" index="463">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flamin’ hot chips, the\nwhole bag. Traps the\nfoe for a few turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00464" index="464">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The whole block’s\nlights go out. The\nfoes fall asleep in\nthe dark.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00465" index="465">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pollen count: EXTREME.\nThe foe sneezes so\nhard it hurts. May\nsharply lower Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00466" index="466">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somebody let one go in\nthe elevator. May\nraise all the user’s\nstats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00467" index="467">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ghost rides the whip.\nVanishes, then hits\nnext turn.</language>
	</row>
</body>
